   "source": [
    "## 7. Use Stratified 5-Fold Cross-Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** A single train/test split can give a result that depends on which rows happened to be selected. Stratified 5-fold cross-validation repeats evaluation across five folds while preserving the approximate class balance in each fold.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Important:** The scaler is inside the pipeline, so it is fitted separately within each training fold and does not leak information from the validation fold."
   ]
  },
