   "source": [
    "## 9. Tune an RBF SVM with Grid Search\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Demonstrate systematic hyperparameter tuning rather than choosing parameters by guesswork. `GridSearchCV` tests combinations of `C` and `gamma` using cross-validation.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Good practice:** Search and cross-validation happen only on the training split. The test split is held back until the selected model is evaluated, giving a less biased estimate of generalization."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "4a95e3b5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Best parameters: {'svc__C': 10, 'svc__gamma': 1}\n",
      "Best mean CV macro F1: 0.973\n",
      "Test accuracy: 0.920\n",
      "\n",
      "Test-set classification report\n",
      "              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n",
      "\n",
      "           0       0.92      0.92      0.92        13\n",
      "           1       0.92      0.92      0.92        12\n",
      "\n",
      "    accuracy                           0.92        25\n",
      "   macro avg       0.92      0.92      0.92        25\n",
      "weighted avg       0.92      0.92      0.92        25\n",
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 2 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "tune_X, tune_y = datasets[0]  # Moons dataset\n",
    "X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n",
    "    tune_X, tune_y, test_size=0.25, random_state=42, stratify=tune_y\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "svm_pipeline = make_pipeline(\n",
    "    StandardScaler(),\n",
    "    SVC(kernel=\"rbf\", random_state=42)\n",
    ")\n",
    "param_grid = {\n",
    "    \"svc__C\": [0.1, 1, 10, 100],\n",
    "    \"svc__gamma\": [\"scale\", 0.1, 1, 10],\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "grid_search = GridSearchCV(\n",
